      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Escreva um parágrafo descrevendo sua rotina diária. Use pelo menos 7 verbos diferentes.",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Exemplo:",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\"I wake up at 7 am. I brush my teeth and take a shower. After that, I have breakfast and go to work. I usually start work at 9 am and finish at 5 pm. When I get home, I relax, watch TV, and have dinner. I go to bed at 10 pm.\"",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "italic"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
