          },
          {
            "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\"On weekends, I usually wake up late. I always have a big breakfast and sometimes go out with my friends. In the afternoon, I rarely stay at home — I prefer going to the park. At night, I often watch movies or play video games. I never go to bed early on weekends.\"",
            "marks": [
